{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, upgrade filled, adventure that goes from curious kitty to unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.\u00a0 Stomp, explore, and uncover cozy forest secrets with your magical fairy guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Collect hidden treasures\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Survive wild winds\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Customize your character\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong> is a gentle, whimsical adventure where you guide a curious cat through a crunchy leaf-filled forest using a magical fairy (your mouse cursor). Stomp leaves, uncover secrets, and explore hand-crafted areas filled with cozy atmosphere and charming surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple point and click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hand crafted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden rhythm mechanic - time your triple stomps to the music to unleash powerful waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization (50+ variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression paths with quests, hidden items, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong>: ~3-4+ hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i> and prepare to leaf your worries behind</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Streamers are Saying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI\u2019ve come to the conclusion this game is weirdly therapeutic!\u201d -ImCade</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> A HUGE thank you to our fans for providing the German, Italian, Russian, and Brazilian Portuguese in-game translations! To make the game accessible to everyone, the store page and all other translations were created with AI assistance. We always welcome new fan translations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prestigious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/2762d885bf32bf37a21ac878745d98b1d2f36e92.jpg"},{"name":"Crunch a leaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/6475893d23eb99c38ef92a1206cf3d84f50c6a5b.jpg"},{"name":"Roast a leaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/07ab0afef36e53aac8fe4fe17935806b7a569dd6.jpg"},{"name":"Activate a windstorm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/02cb7ec73707aabbb2640f99480fd7eab4cb0377.jpg"},{"name":"Become a Real Civil Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/582d2cabff80cbc600944846f7d7b46a66b904f3.jpg"},{"name":"Bush Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/18b457a3ef217e154cfefb4aa6cc91d01c0cd2d9.jpg"},{"name":"Found the nuts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/12395ad2b717184d91f82ddf8bf68bed1a133bd8.jpg"},{"name":"Denim, Denim, Denim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/a8dd3d20ecc855e210bdae50674ecda6d98ee7e1.jpg"},{"name":"Smashing Pumpkins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721660/de71d89af494381567527340977f3139219ae47a.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721660?t=1765834392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721660?t=1765834392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/1d47d1a9d6ddab69fe104d89897c76758a0b3666/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765834392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/1d47d1a9d6ddab69fe104d89897c76758a0b3666/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765834392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3920060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, upgrade filled, adventure that goes from curious kitty to unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.\u00a0 Stomp, explore, and uncover cozy forest secrets with your magical fairy guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Collect hidden treasures\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Survive wild winds\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.poster.avif?t=1765834392\" aria-label=\"Customize your character\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.webm?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.mp4?t=1765834392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong> is a gentle, whimsical adventure where you guide a curious cat through a crunchy leaf-filled forest using a magical fairy (your mouse cursor). Stomp leaves, uncover secrets, and explore hand-crafted areas filled with cozy atmosphere and charming surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple point and click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hand crafted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden rhythm mechanic - time your triple stomps to the music to unleash powerful waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization (50+ variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression paths with quests, hidden items, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong>: ~3-4+ hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i> and prepare to leaf your worries behind</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Streamers are Saying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI\u2019ve come to the conclusion this game is weirdly therapeutic!\u201d -ImCade</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> A HUGE thank you to our fans for providing the German, Italian, Russian, and Brazilian Portuguese in-game translations! To make the game accessible to everyone, the store page and all other translations were created with AI assistance. We always welcome new fan translations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jobblesack Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam